# TokenDash Vibe-Coding Rules

- Framework: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- State: Zustand (Client), TanStack Query (API Polling)
- Theme: Linear/Stripe dark mode (#09090b background, slate borders, emerald/neon accents)
- Icons: Lucide React
- Security: Never store API keys in plain text or localStorage. Isolate keys in local memory or encrypted vault handlers.
